  {
    "episode_id": 79349,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/9/79349.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "You know, I do find that interesting. It's just not in my nature to do that. And that's interesting. I haven't ever dealt with opposition or conflict that way. But it's interesting from the other perspective, from someone that isn't passive aggressive, I find that when I am dealing with someone that's passive aggressive, I have a tendency of kind of feeling lost. But also, I guess kind of upset because I realize that person is acting out, but acting from a different place. And I guess maybe they don't respect me enough to just be honest or just to come to the table and us conversate.",
