    "turn_idx": 43,
    "turn_text": "Well, I understand this. It is hard to get someone else to change. And so, but ask yourself first, is there something that I can do to make my life better? Whether that is saying, you know, I'm dealing with a tough time of work. I will do other things in my life, whether it is relaxation, whether it's taking walks, whether it's going to church or praying more or reading about successful people, redirect my life, energize my life so I can handle this. Second, take your own inventory. Am I doing this myself? write things down, take the quizzes in our book or listen to our audio in the book, but do those things to understand it, ask yourself those things and process it forward. And then third, look at the tips of what you can do to redirect someone, don't attack them, don't be mean back, but you're trying to redirect them at least to some extent where you can make things work better in your life and their life. And I think there you'll see some accomplishments coming through.",
